<<declare $toldKieranAboutVision to false>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][As you round the corner, a force comes over you that makes you stop in your tracks. Déjà vu. You feel like you've been here last night.][/nomarkup] #line:0659906
<<jump flashback>>
===
title: flashback
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You are walking down the alley with a man you have trouble recognizing. Not just any man.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He is the man you found dead in your shower earlier tonight.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][At the end of the alleyway, where the passage opens up to the street, you see a woman that waits for you.][/nomarkup] #line:0c2c0f6
Mysterious Woman: You made it. #line:066a4a7
<<jump kieranInterrupts>>
===
title: kieranInterrupts
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran waves his hand before your eyes.][/nomarkup] #line:033a717
{$kieran}: Can you hear me?  #line:0276754
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You catch your bearings, Kieran's voice grounding you.][/nomarkup] #line:05445cd
{$kieran}: You spaced out. Is everything alright? #line:05ffba6
-> {$pcName}: I had some sort of “vision.” #line:07814b4
    <<set $toldKieranAboutVision to true>>
    <<jump toldAboutVision>>
-> {$pcName}: Don't worry about it. #line:04dd301
    <<jump dontTellAboutVision>>
===
title: toldAboutVision
---
<<ModifyInfluence 1 {$kieran}>>
{$kieran}: Do not tell me Dominic was wrong, and you are actually a Malkavian. (+1 Kieran Influence) #line:094a46c
-> {$pcName}: What's a Malkavian? #line:0bb2389
{$kieran}: Another clan. Not important right now. Please, tell me about this vision. #line:017c8bd
-> {$pcName}: I was in this alley last night with the guy... #line:0e53e4b
{$kieran}: The man you killed? #line:088ce81
-> {$pcName}: ...A woman was with us, too. #line:06a1d4a
{$kieran}: Could be your sire. It seems as if we are hot on her trail, if your recollection is to be trusted.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][His expression visibly brightens just the tiniest bit at the notion. It's a proverbial light at the end of the tunnel, something to latch onto.][/nomarkup] #line:083b5f9
<<jump backDoor>>
===
title: dontTellAboutVision
---
{$kieran}: Your dissociation is one thing, but withholding potentially helpful information is another. It did not seem like [nomarkup]<i>nothing</i>[/nomarkup]. If you are sure, though... I will take your word for it. (-1 Kieran Influence)
<<ModifyInfluence -1 {$kieran}>>
{$kieran}: Do your best to maintain focus. We are running short on time. #line:04c605f
<<jump backDoor>>
===